    {
        "text": "The Ge\u2014the doctor will be here soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough*, *cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you crying, Viviana?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think I have the strength to wipe away your tears anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're too kind, too gentle...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "text": "I often think back to the day we first met.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had come from Zwillingst\u00fcrme to Sturmland just to take you out of Werner's spire. You huddled in the back seat, holding onto your tiny suitcase and leaning gently against my chest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was wondering: Was this little girl scared to leave her father? *cough* Scared of life in foreign Kazimierz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "text": "But no. You were just trying to stay low, so no one would see your horns and cause trouble for Werner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though it was so late at night, and no one would have paid attention to a car leaving the great spires of the Kurf\u00fcrst.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were so little back then...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't remember that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nein. You do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can lament, you can blame, you can mourn, you can regret, you can rage... *cough* All that, and only then can you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please... don't leave me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the only one I have left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me 'see' you... one last time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm right here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm so glad I can't see the expression on your face right now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You deserve a better life than this, Viviana... If there really is one...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
