    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 2,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Tall as the empress's tower is, it is not endless. Or so she believes."
    },
    {
        "text": "The spiral staircase extends before her, but direction itself seems to be torn apart by some unknown, irreversible power. She keeps moving forward, but she can't make any progress."
    },
    {
        "text": "Viviana is tired, and when one is tired, it is easy to notice what one has lost."
    },
    {
        "text": "Not unlike the twenty-two years of her life."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_openftstprun",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "a"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "a",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown3",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you lost?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Viviana looks up."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1122_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "She sees a young Caprinae woman, whose face is filled with curiosity and concern."
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I must have bumped into you in my hurry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4098_vvana_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1122_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you okay? You look very pale.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4098_vvana_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine... I was just thinking about something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4098_vvana_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know this place well?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1122_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ja, I live nearby.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4098_vvana_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where does this lead?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1122_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you come here on your own?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where it leads is entirely up to where you want to go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1122_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take care, now. I'll be going.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_openftstprun",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4098_vvana_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where I want to go...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "40,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Viviana's fingers brush the handrail next to her. Ochre paint covers the emblem of Urtica under a thick layer of dust, so bright it could have been painted yesterday."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Witch King.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "She recalls the historical novel <i>Die Glut</i>."
    },
    {
        "text": "When the Witch King first ascended to the throne, he gave his builders a blueprint of the Genesis Spire, a monument so great, the likes of which Leithanien had never seen."
    },
    {
        "text": "Simply gazing upon the plans was enough to make one short of breath, as though standing before its foundation."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Witch King was scrupulous about every last detail of the Genesis Spire, down to the materials and paints used for every fence and railing, which must never fade in color."
    },
    {
        "text": "It would become the sole symbol of Leithanien."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_wtchkgtwrfll",
        "volume": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4098_vvana_1#10$1",
        "duration": 1,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Has the Genesis Horn fully descended?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that woman just now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4098_vvana_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Viviana comes to a startling realization."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Caprinae who just passed by was like one of the young people living on the outskirts of Zwillingst\u00fcrme. In the prime of her life, busy and tireless, her voice emanating the warmth of a fresh cup of tea."
    },
    {
        "text": "She should not be here. Neither at the empress' spire, nor in the Genesis Horn."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Viviana turns around. No one is there."
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you, Viviana?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are <i>you</i> here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you come back to Leithanien? Why did you leave?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Viviana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
