        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Failed to reach bottom of staircase after forty-five minutes. Attempt unsuccessful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Federico has spent a long time on the staircase of the empress's spire. He stops in his tracks after yet another failed attempt."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the most basic level, Arts are a rigid form of order.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Twin Empresses would not have hired a mentally ill architect to design their Spires, and no artificer could have recreated such orderless architecture.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My judgment was impaired due to my experience at Ludwigs-Universit\u00e4t's Sonata Spire... The distortion occurring within this tower is unrelated to Arts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Has the Genesis Horn covered the entire spire, causing changes in reality?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "Arturia's music is also absent...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_gunshot",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
