    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "After a brief pause, Federico pulls out his shotgun and fires in front of him."
    },
    {
        "text": "The sound of the gunshot fills the space, but the projectiles vanish right before his eyes, as though wiped away by some formless something."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Herr Sankta!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_timestop",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "As he hears the sound, Federico sees the projectiles again, now moving with a slow and clear trajectory, like a rock skipping across the water. Ripples spread, and everything beneath the surface is revealed."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "44_g12_multispace",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_gunload",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1122_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$higherdimensionalspaces_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1122_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Put away your gun, please!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1122_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Put away your gun, please!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do not require you to repeat yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've heard something similar from everyone I met on this mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1122_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course you did. This is Zwillingst\u00fcrme, not Laterano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Loris always liked to talk about Laterano. He said that when the Sankta go out, they 'bang' any buildings they don't like, and 'bang' the buildings they <i>do</i> like even more eagerly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jan and I used to think he was making things up because he didn't like his hometown very much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1122_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, look around you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_signlntrfrnc",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "bgeffect",
        "name": "$eb_signalInterference",
        "fade": true,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "layer": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Zwillingst\u00fcrme is an old city. Any brick or tile could have a score or a poem etched on it by a drunk artist from a century ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Federico quickly assesses the sight before him."
    },
    {
        "text": "If this place is the Genesis Horn, where the Witch King's legacy is kept, Arturia's final destination..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Then it is difficult to believe that his bullets could have broken through some sort of barrier and brought him here from that strange staircase."
    },
    {
        "text": "Federico examines the woman before him. The anger on her face is no more and no less than that of a citizen performing her civic duty to stop a rude tourist."
    },
    {
        "tag": "bgeffect"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1122_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you understand me, Herr Sankta? Put away your gun... please.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excuse me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "We are clearly not on the streets of Zwillingst\u00fcrme, but you seem unaware of this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have mentioned a Loris and a Jan. Assuming you are referring to Loris Bordin and Jan Sch\u00fcler...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, tell me your name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1122_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yulia... Yulia Sch\u00fcler.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "44_g12_multispace",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is inside the Genesis Horn? The Witch King's resting place?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the Witch King...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop looking around, little angel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You caught up... I'm not surprised.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wish I could say the same. The last thing I expected was for you to actually cling to a Lich's thread and be voluntarily Exiled.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So where is the Witch King?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dead. What else?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I should be able to sense him. His Arts, his emotions, his will... if I just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Arturia looks around. It is a space without boundaries, defined by only indescribable flows of light like the respiration of the void."
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She steadies her cello, puts her hand on the strings, and sets her bow."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
        "text": "Bow touches string, but the vibration produces no sound. The motion familiar to her, so natural, has lost all meaning here."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$suspenseful_intro",
        "key": "$suspenseful_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Finally noticed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't play.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've... lost my music.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it because of the Genesis Horn? Or the 'rules' of the Witch King?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Arrogant. Foolish. Witless. That petty halo over your head is shedding light on your pale face. I wish it could do the same to your brain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where do you think you are right now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "Inside Herkunftshorn's coffin? A treasure trove of the Pashas of Sargon? A witch's magic pocket from a Victorian fairy tale?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Herr Fremont...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sarkaz) 'The beginning and end of all threads.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "As though muttering to himself, Fremont speaks an unfamiliar word in Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or maybe the name he gave it would be more in line with your understanding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Leithanian) Desolate Domain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kargereich?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What you're seeing is the other side of the 'real,' a dimension always in flux. Any rule, any reality disintegrates before it in an instant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "Through the long eons, the Liches have caught only glimpses of it, and despite Herkunftshorn's life's work, the best he could manage was to create a tiny, volatile bubble in this infinite void.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Arturia does not respond to Fremont's anger. She simply touches the strings again. The unbroken hush."
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no disappointment or fear, only confusion."
    },
    {
        "text": "An emotion that only flashes across Arturia's face before she looks up and smiles."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perfect.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "So the Witch King didn't prolong his will through mystical arts, but instead created his own retreat in Kargereich.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "This pocket still exists, so he must be here... It's just that there's still a ways to go to reach his throne.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Aren't you curious what happens if you're Exiled again in Kargereich?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_strngspllmgc",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_skill_darkholeborn",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Arturia realizes that the shadows are growing."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Lich's witchcraft had been moving while she was speaking. Thread-like shadows grow into thick vines around Fremont, merging into the ambiguous colors of the ground, and begin to come at her."
    },
    {
        "text": "Death and extinction. Decay in its full bloom."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I still haven't found my answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to rediscover my music. I must perform the Witch King.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#9$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "...die yet."
    },
    {
        "text": "She is perfectly willing to meet her end performing. But what she can't accept is to fade into silence, with the truth so near."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_smoke_grenade",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_lightrain_loop",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "b"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#9$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The shadows crack, and a gray rain rushes up to engulf all."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_rockfall",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 4,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 90,
        "randomness": 50,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#5$1",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "0,-10",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_signlntrfrnc",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "bgeffect",
        "name": "$eb_signalInterference",
        "fade": true,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "layer": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_pipeorgantimer",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Der Wiener Uhrturm rings!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Witch King's Musician"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go, to the Genesis Spire! The performance begins\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Witch King's Musician"
    },
    {
        "text": "New music, new Arts... protecting Vedunien against Catastrophe and the cannons of Gaul...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Witch King's Musician"
    },
    {
        "text": "Herk... Herkunftshorn...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Witch King's Musician"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#12$1",
        "bstart": 0.3,
        "bend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#12$1",
        "bstart": 0.3,
        "bend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reality is unstable here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was it caused by the Exile?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, it was like this before we entered Kargereich. Herkunftshorn's power is diminishing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1114_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...The Genesis Horn's collapse is accelerating.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fremont"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "b",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
